<h3>Here are all the buzz about Honey Bees</h3>
<p>The domestic Honey Bees (Apis melifera), also freuently spelled "honey bee" and known scientifically as the European or western honey bee, is the most common of the nine species of honey-producing bees. it is nattive to Africa. Europe and the Middle East.</p>
<h2>Beekeeping or apiculture</h2>
<p>It is the human management of honey bee colonies. Morden beekeepers use human-made bee hives that are typically boxes with rows of wooden frames that bees fill with wax honeycomb.The hives are designed togive bee keepers access to collect honey and help maintain the nest</p>
<h3>Why honey bees are important?</h3>
<p>Honey bees produce several produces that are useful to people ,notably honey and beeswax. </p>


